WEBVTT

00:01:33.180 --> 00:01:35.510
<i>The Great Kanto Desert.</i>

00:01:35.510 --> 00:01:40.120
<i>A hell in which nothing moves
and nothing grows.</i>

00:01:40.120 --> 00:01:43.320
<i>If thrown out into this hell
with no equipment whatsoever,</i>

00:01:43.320 --> 00:01:46.190
<i>one would die in half a day's time.</i>

00:01:46.190 --> 00:01:50.830
<i>The tremulous sand, much like water,
robs one of energy</i>

00:01:50.830 --> 00:01:57.240
<i>as exhalation steadily depletes
moisture from the entire body.</i>

00:01:57.240 --> 00:01:59.440
<i>Temperatures reach 60 degrees Celsius,</i>

00:01:59.440 --> 00:02:03.910
<i>but with no humidity in the air,
it drops a bit in the shade,</i>

00:02:03.910 --> 00:02:07.410
<i>and the evaporation of sweat
also takes away some heat.</i>

00:02:07.410 --> 00:02:13.650
<i>Even still, the apparent temperature
of 50 degrees makes one's mind hazy...</i>

00:02:14.720 --> 00:02:20.560
<i>Desert dwellers use desert equipment
to cross the desert.</i>

00:02:20.560 --> 00:02:26.060
<i>However, Sunabuozu and friend
only possess the very bare minimum.</i>

00:02:26.060 --> 00:02:29.430
<i>The hellish survival has begun.</i>

00:02:38.480 --> 00:02:42.390
<i>You're going to blow the well up
and poison it?!</i>

00:02:42.390 --> 00:02:44.270
Yep. If I do that,

00:02:44.270 --> 00:02:48.390
the Edogawa Gang here'll
probably leave town.

00:02:48.990 --> 00:02:52.820
<i>Get real! Are you insane?!
If you do that...</i>

00:02:52.820 --> 00:02:55.760
<i>...I won't let you do me!</i>

00:02:55.760 --> 00:02:57.760
Eh?! No way!

00:02:57.760 --> 00:03:01.270
<i>I told you it was so we
could live like people!</i>

00:03:01.270 --> 00:03:05.700
<i>Even if the bandits do leave,
what good is an unusable well?!</i>

00:03:05.700 --> 00:03:09.740
<i>If you blow it up,
I swear I won't let you do me!</i>

00:03:09.740 --> 00:03:13.110
That's not fair!
That's breach of contract!

00:03:13.110 --> 00:03:17.480
<i>Doing me wasn't in the contract,
so I can refuse to if I want!</i>

00:03:19.350 --> 00:03:21.050
<i>Do?</i>

00:03:21.050 --> 00:03:24.060
<i>What was she gonna let him do?</i>

00:03:24.060 --> 00:03:29.390
<i>Mariko... What exactly
is this "doing" business?</i>

00:03:29.390 --> 00:03:32.100
<i>Well, you see, Chief...</i>

00:03:32.100 --> 00:03:36.120
<i>What?! "Do" as in that "do"?!</i>

00:03:37.300 --> 00:03:39.240
<i>Chief!</i>

00:03:39.240 --> 00:03:40.470
<i>Dad!</i>

00:03:40.470 --> 00:03:44.640
<i>Oh no! He's fainted!</i>

00:03:44.640 --> 00:03:46.410
<i>What now, Sunabouzu?</i>

00:03:46.410 --> 00:03:49.400
<i>Seems you can't afford
to destroy the well now...</i>

00:03:50.880 --> 00:03:54.010
<i>Mariko is hot, after all...</i>

00:03:55.970 --> 00:03:58.670
Alright! Here's my condition!

00:03:58.670 --> 00:03:59.750
<i>Condition?</i>

00:03:59.750 --> 00:04:04.810
I doubt you guys'd leave if I threatened
to destroy the well otherwise?

00:04:04.810 --> 00:04:06.040
<i>Obviously.</i>

00:04:06.640 --> 00:04:11.370
Then what if I challenged you right now
to a fight for the village?

00:04:11.750 --> 00:04:13.380
<i>A challenge?</i>

00:04:13.380 --> 00:04:17.050
That nitro is super low-grade stuff
I found lying around,

00:04:17.050 --> 00:04:19.820
so it'll still be tough
to get rid of afterwards...

00:04:19.820 --> 00:04:24.490
<i>We're game, but what about you?</i>

00:04:24.490 --> 00:04:28.930
<i>Who was it who ran off,
tail between his legs, again?!</i>

00:04:28.930 --> 00:04:30.830
Great! It's decided!

00:04:42.010 --> 00:04:44.450
<i>Hey, is that a real bomb?</i>

00:04:44.450 --> 00:04:47.350
<i>I wouldn't put it past that twerp!</i>

00:04:55.790 --> 00:04:56.960
Hook detachment!

00:04:56.960 --> 00:04:57.790
Wind-up!

00:04:57.790 --> 00:04:59.190
Instant launching!

00:05:00.460 --> 00:05:02.170
Yay!

00:05:02.170 --> 00:05:03.430
<i>Bastard!</i>

00:05:04.900 --> 00:05:06.530
<i>Damn you!</i>

00:05:11.610 --> 00:05:15.170
<i>Guess this's the end
of that infernal jackass!</i>

00:05:15.550 --> 00:05:20.220
<i>But that means the village belongs
to those bandits now! Dammit!</i>

00:05:20.220 --> 00:05:24.400
<i>No, if we're lucky,
they might knock each other out!</i>

00:05:24.820 --> 00:05:26.480
<i>Unbelievable...</i>

00:05:27.560 --> 00:05:30.890
<i>In which case, we might
be able to kill 'em!</i>

00:05:30.890 --> 00:05:34.860
<i>Hey, yeah! This could be our chance!</i>

00:05:34.860 --> 00:05:39.670
<i>Despite his insanity, he's lured
them to an advantageous location,</i>

00:05:39.670 --> 00:05:41.500
<i>as he first planned!</i>

00:05:45.840 --> 00:05:47.400
<i>Eep!</i>

00:05:49.510 --> 00:05:50.880
<i>What do you think?</i>

00:05:50.880 --> 00:05:52.520
<i>I don't like it!</i>

00:05:52.520 --> 00:05:55.790
<i>It's like he wants to lure us
out there! What do we do?!</i>

00:05:55.790 --> 00:05:58.590
<i>I'm sure he's got
somethin' up his sleeve!</i>

00:05:58.590 --> 00:06:02.460
<i>Quit worryin'! He can't
do nothin' at this range!</i>

00:06:02.460 --> 00:06:04.890
<i>He'd get caught up in it too!</i>

00:06:04.890 --> 00:06:07.560
<i>We'll beat him down
before he can do anything!</i>

00:06:13.470 --> 00:06:17.110
<i>- Damn, lost him!
- Nimble freak!</i>

00:06:17.110 --> 00:06:19.070
<i>He can't have gotten far!</i>

00:06:21.940 --> 00:06:23.470
It's all-you-can-shoot!

00:06:25.550 --> 00:06:26.580
<i>I'm falling!</i>

00:06:26.580 --> 00:06:28.170
<i>Bastard!</i>

00:06:38.930 --> 00:06:40.700
<i>Looks like it's over.</i>

00:06:40.700 --> 00:06:43.530
<i>Talk about a pain in the ass...</i>

00:06:47.540 --> 00:06:50.060
<i>Gonna blow up the well
'cause you can't win?</i>

00:06:50.770 --> 00:06:54.080
<i>What a sore-ass loser!</i>

00:06:54.080 --> 00:06:58.750
<i>Hand over the detonator
and we'll let you live.</i>

00:06:58.750 --> 00:07:02.280
I really didn't want
to have to use this...

00:07:03.220 --> 00:07:05.850
<i>Damn you!</i>

00:07:19.640 --> 00:07:22.910
This detonator wasn't
for the bomb in the well,

00:07:22.910 --> 00:07:25.480
it was for traps I set in the ruins!

00:07:25.480 --> 00:07:28.440
Didn't expect that, did ya?!

00:07:28.440 --> 00:07:34.180
<i>I can't believe you jumped into
your own trap to lure us into it!</i>

00:07:34.180 --> 00:07:37.850
Shut up! I had no choice!
You guys wouldn't get off my tail!

00:07:37.850 --> 00:07:39.250
Crap!

00:07:52.100 --> 00:07:54.440
<i>You really have gone crazy!</i>

00:07:54.440 --> 00:07:57.170
Shut up! Go to Hell!

00:07:57.170 --> 00:07:59.900
<i>Screw you! You're the one who's dyin'!</i>

00:08:04.110 --> 00:08:05.840
<i>Die!</i>

00:08:14.360 --> 00:08:17.260
<i>He used me as a springboard!</i>

00:08:21.100 --> 00:08:23.860
<i>He used me as a springboard too!</i>

00:08:25.370 --> 00:08:27.630
You're a springboard too!

00:08:32.140 --> 00:08:36.010
Special Attack! Sunabo Jet Stream Kick!

00:08:47.390 --> 00:08:49.690
<i>The Sunabouzu won!</i>

00:08:49.690 --> 00:08:52.090
<i>The village is saved...</i>

00:08:52.090 --> 00:08:54.330
As if I'd lose.

00:08:54.330 --> 00:08:56.100
<i>Holy moly...</i>

00:08:56.100 --> 00:09:01.630
Patch these guys up. They'll be
worth a lot handed over alive...

00:09:05.440 --> 00:09:09.040
<i>What about the bomb in the well?!</i>

00:09:10.550 --> 00:09:12.880
That reminds me, didn't you guys say,

00:09:12.880 --> 00:09:17.550
"Kill that lunatic right this minute,"
or something to that effect?

00:09:21.020 --> 00:09:23.990
The nitro bottles are filled
with ordinary water.

00:09:23.990 --> 00:09:27.360
The poison is a fake made
from sand and ink.

00:09:29.800 --> 00:09:32.740
<i>- It was a fake!
- Whew!</i>

00:09:32.740 --> 00:09:34.540
<i>Should've guessed!</i>

00:09:34.540 --> 00:09:37.560
<i>He'd never destroy the well like that!</i>

00:09:40.580 --> 00:09:43.680
The whole lot of you...

00:09:43.680 --> 00:09:50.390
You're nothing but poor, filthy,
stinking, spineless pushovers!

00:09:50.390 --> 00:09:52.250
You make me sick!

00:09:56.530 --> 00:09:58.720
Mariko-chan...

00:10:09.770 --> 00:10:12.140
Ow!

00:10:14.010 --> 00:10:17.000
<i>How are you feeling?</i>

00:10:24.450 --> 00:10:26.620
Mari-chan!

00:10:26.620 --> 00:10:31.060
Oh, Mari-chan! Thank you
for taking care of me!

00:10:31.060 --> 00:10:35.830
And that outfit...
erotic beyond words!

00:10:38.270 --> 00:10:41.970
<i>I did make a promise...</i>

00:10:41.970 --> 00:10:45.070
So you're willing?!

00:10:45.070 --> 00:10:47.380
Mari-chan.

00:10:47.380 --> 00:10:49.610
You're beautiful.

00:10:49.610 --> 00:10:51.310
<i>Kanta-san...</i>

00:10:59.790 --> 00:11:02.160
<i>Let go of me!</i>

00:11:05.730 --> 00:11:07.430
I'm burning up!

00:11:07.430 --> 00:11:08.730
Tamehiko?!

00:11:08.730 --> 00:11:10.970
<i>Yeah, it's me.</i>

00:11:10.970 --> 00:11:13.440
Where are we?!

00:11:13.440 --> 00:11:15.770
What am I doing here?!

00:11:15.770 --> 00:11:20.980
<i>They decided to kick you out
once you'd beaten the Edogawa Gang...</i>

00:11:20.980 --> 00:11:23.010
What?!

00:11:23.010 --> 00:11:26.320
<i>They weren't too fond of ya...</i>

00:11:26.320 --> 00:11:31.750
<i>And I coulda been village chief
had I played my cards right...</i>

00:11:31.750 --> 00:11:34.190
So what the hell're you doing here?!

00:11:35.090 --> 00:11:38.890
<i>I'm not welcome there anymore,
thanks to someone!</i>

00:11:38.890 --> 00:11:44.130
<i>So I thought I'd have you take me
to some town somewhere.</i>

00:11:44.130 --> 00:11:47.000
Like I can really trust a spy.

00:11:47.000 --> 00:11:50.040
<i>It's the truth! Believe me!</i>

00:11:50.040 --> 00:11:54.680
Eh?! This is all the food
and water we got?!

00:11:54.680 --> 00:11:57.410
Didn't you bring anything?!

00:11:57.410 --> 00:11:59.250
<i>I used it all up...</i>

00:11:59.250 --> 00:12:00.180
Idiot!

00:12:02.620 --> 00:12:03.920
What's that?

00:12:02.620 --> 00:12:03.920
<i>"Sunabozu"</i>

00:12:03.920 --> 00:12:10.790
<i>"Dear Sunabozu, I genuinely feel
bad about what has happened."</i>

00:12:10.790 --> 00:12:14.600
<i>"To be honest, now that my eyes are open,"</i>

00:12:14.600 --> 00:12:18.070
<i>"I am truly terrified as I reflect
on your tyrannical ways."</i>

00:12:18.070 --> 00:12:23.170
<i>"There's also my daughter Mariko.
I've thought hard about this."</i>

00:12:23.170 --> 00:12:27.410
<i>"I pray that you make a safe
return to your home town."</i>

00:12:27.410 --> 00:12:30.310
<i>"Sincerely, Village Chief."</i>

00:12:32.880 --> 00:12:35.180
Damn ingrates!

00:12:35.180 --> 00:12:38.950
We're going back! Lead the way!

00:12:39.890 --> 00:12:45.430
<i>You can't be serious! It's half a
day by truck! It'd take days on foot!</i>

00:12:45.430 --> 00:12:49.200
<i>Plus there's no telling what'll
happen to me if I go back!</i>

00:12:49.200 --> 00:12:52.570
Oh, okay. Then die.

00:12:52.570 --> 00:12:57.270
If you don't wanna go, I'll go alone.
You can die like a dog here.

00:13:19.500 --> 00:13:22.230
<i>Let me have some too!</i>

00:13:24.130 --> 00:13:27.730
Under normal circumstances,
I wouldn't give him a single drop...

00:13:29.870 --> 00:13:32.310
<i>That's so good!</i>

00:13:32.310 --> 00:13:35.240
That's all the water we get at a time.

00:13:35.240 --> 00:13:38.080
<i>I'd like some more...</i>

00:13:38.080 --> 00:13:40.880
<i>But you're right, we need to save it...</i>

00:13:40.880 --> 00:13:44.550
Anyways, are you sure
the village is this way?

00:13:44.550 --> 00:13:46.560
<i>Yes, very sure.</i>

00:13:46.560 --> 00:13:51.030
Just you watch, you bums...
You will pay for this!

00:13:51.030 --> 00:13:52.630
And!

00:13:52.630 --> 00:13:57.030
Mari-chan! Don't forget
about your promise, now!

00:13:58.470 --> 00:14:00.800
Well, let's quit yakkin' and get moving!

00:14:00.800 --> 00:14:03.670
<i>Eh? I wanna rest a little more!</i>

00:14:03.670 --> 00:14:06.340
I already told you every second counts!

00:14:06.340 --> 00:14:09.810
<i>They'll hang me if I go back there...</i>

00:14:09.810 --> 00:14:13.150
<i>When I think about that,
my legs get heavy...</i>

00:14:17.150 --> 00:14:19.150
Alright, I'll put in
a good word for you.

00:14:19.150 --> 00:14:23.830
<i>Really?! Then put it in a contract
so you won't break your promise!</i>

00:14:23.830 --> 00:14:25.320
Oh, geez...

00:14:26.300 --> 00:14:30.500
<i>I'm acting all humble,
but I'm really the one in charge here!</i>

00:14:30.500 --> 00:14:33.600
<i>I'll keep using this trick
to make things easier for me!</i>

00:14:33.600 --> 00:14:39.440
Keeping this sly moron's hopes up
by giving him small benefits

00:14:39.440 --> 00:14:42.140
will actually benefit me in the long run!

00:14:50.550 --> 00:14:53.560
<i>Nights. 10 degrees below freezing.</i>

00:14:53.560 --> 00:14:56.460
<i>The sunlight that so intensely
beat down during the afternoon</i>

00:14:56.460 --> 00:14:58.990
<i>is no longer reflected by all the sand,</i>

00:14:58.990 --> 00:15:02.100
<i>thereby transforming the desert
into a frigid wasteland.</i>

00:15:02.100 --> 00:15:05.360
<i>This, too, significantly
robs one of strength.</i>

00:15:06.940 --> 00:15:09.940
<i>I'm sleepy! I'm so tired!</i>

00:15:09.940 --> 00:15:11.910
Idiot! Fall asleep and you'll die!

00:15:11.910 --> 00:15:15.040
<i>I don't care... Let me sleep...</i>

00:15:15.040 --> 00:15:17.150
I can't have you die here!

00:15:17.150 --> 00:15:18.250
How pathetic!

00:15:18.250 --> 00:15:21.720
Why do me and this grubby stinkman...

00:15:21.720 --> 00:15:24.650
...gotta hold each other?!

00:15:25.890 --> 00:15:28.820
Mari-chan!

00:15:28.820 --> 00:15:33.400
<i>Yikes, this one part's all hard...</i>

00:15:33.400 --> 00:15:35.920
<i>I'm not into that, just so you know.</i>

00:15:37.400 --> 00:15:38.500
<i>What was that for?!</i>

00:15:38.500 --> 00:15:40.400
Stay outta my dreams!

00:16:19.880 --> 00:16:21.840
W-water!

00:16:24.110 --> 00:16:26.050
Mariko-chan...

00:16:28.150 --> 00:16:29.920
<i>Kanta-san?</i>

00:16:29.920 --> 00:16:31.990
What is this?!

00:16:31.990 --> 00:16:35.090
<i>The vein of water we struck
was bigger than we thought,</i>

00:16:35.090 --> 00:16:37.690
<i>so now we have more water
than we'll ever need!</i>

00:16:37.690 --> 00:16:40.330
<i>Anyways, Kanta-san...</i>

00:16:40.330 --> 00:16:43.670
<i>Let me fulfill my promise to you...</i>

00:16:43.670 --> 00:16:46.160
This time it's not a dream, right?

00:16:47.170 --> 00:16:48.760
Mariko-chan...

00:16:51.770 --> 00:16:53.970
It was a dream...

00:17:00.780 --> 00:17:02.150
Bastard!

00:17:13.660 --> 00:17:16.270
<i>The water! The water! The water!</i>

00:17:16.270 --> 00:17:18.200
- Damn it!

00:17:16.270 --> 00:17:18.200
<i>- My water!</i>

00:17:18.200 --> 00:17:23.540
That just leaves us
with one-third of a canteen...

00:17:23.540 --> 00:17:29.680
<i>Lu lu la la, li la la</i>

00:17:29.680 --> 00:17:36.050
<i>Lu lu la la, li la lu, lu lu lu</i>

00:17:39.660 --> 00:17:45.690
<i>Fooled by money and breasts</i>

00:17:45.690 --> 00:17:48.860
<i>I find myself being carried away</i>

00:17:48.860 --> 00:17:54.840
<i>bound for the sand, despair, and sun</i>

00:17:54.840 --> 00:18:04.880
<i>at the ends of the end of the world</i>

00:18:04.880 --> 00:18:12.720
<i>Its name is the Great Kanto Desert</i>

00:18:12.720 --> 00:18:18.890
<i>Lu lu la la, li la la</i>

00:18:18.890 --> 00:18:23.800
<i>Lu lu la la, li la lu, lu lu lu</i>

00:18:23.800 --> 00:18:25.970
<i>Gimme water!</i>

00:18:25.970 --> 00:18:28.570
<i>I can't stand it anymore! Give me some!</i>

00:18:28.570 --> 00:18:30.330
Bastard!

00:18:32.640 --> 00:18:40.150
<i>All life-supporting items were
finally used up halfway into the trek.</i>

00:18:40.150 --> 00:18:42.850
<i>Dark desires and want of revenge...</i>

00:18:42.850 --> 00:18:47.620
<i>These were the only things
now supporting the Sunabozu.</i>

00:18:50.430 --> 00:18:53.030
<i>But, he eventually collapsed.</i>

00:18:53.030 --> 00:18:55.860
<i>The Great Kanto Desert
is a harsh mistress.</i>

00:18:57.430 --> 00:19:02.770
<i>"Handyman"</i>

00:19:01.840 --> 00:19:02.770
<i>There he is.</i>

00:19:02.770 --> 00:19:07.110
<i>Yep, this sweltering object
is definitely the Sunabouzu...</i>

00:19:07.110 --> 00:19:08.870
<i>Is he alive?</i>

00:19:10.150 --> 00:19:15.740
<i>He's stranded! The Sunabouzu
is stranded! What a loser!</i>

00:19:17.550 --> 00:19:19.860
<i>How pathetic...</i>

00:19:19.860 --> 00:19:21.720
<i>Let's kill 'im!</i>

00:19:22.720 --> 00:19:27.030
<i>Geez. It's a good thing we
just happened to accept a job</i>

00:19:27.030 --> 00:19:31.830
<i>to show a West Oasis district official
to a southern village.</i>

00:19:31.830 --> 00:19:34.970
<i>You better thank Mariko-san.</i>

00:19:34.970 --> 00:19:39.270
<i>She's the one who hired us to rescue you.</i>

00:19:40.780 --> 00:19:45.950
<i>Two days earlier, at West Oasis District,
Frontier Village #21...</i>

00:19:45.950 --> 00:19:50.650
<i>After all manner of difficulties,
the villagers finally struck water.</i>

00:19:50.650 --> 00:19:53.990
<i>Their hard work had finally paid off.</i>

00:19:56.530 --> 00:19:58.190
<i>Excuse me...</i>

00:19:58.190 --> 00:20:04.000
<i>Are you the handymen from the
same village as the Sunabouzu?</i>

00:20:04.000 --> 00:20:06.570
<i>The truth is...</i>

00:20:06.570 --> 00:20:10.440
<i>You threw him into
the desert, unconscious?!</i>

00:20:10.440 --> 00:20:13.910
<i>My father - the village chief -
abducted him from the clinic</i>

00:20:13.910 --> 00:20:16.140
<i>when I wasn't around...</i>

00:20:18.610 --> 00:20:21.880
<i>That's great! That's hilarious!</i>

00:20:21.880 --> 00:20:23.880
<i>How lame!</i>

00:20:25.090 --> 00:20:27.790
<i>You're killin' me!</i>

00:20:27.790 --> 00:20:30.880
<i>Do you know if he
made it home all right?</i>

00:20:33.960 --> 00:20:37.400
<i>So he got you to agree?</i>

00:20:37.400 --> 00:20:40.240
<i>What an idiotic promise!</i>

00:20:40.240 --> 00:20:42.200
<i>That lowlife pervert!</i>

00:20:42.200 --> 00:20:46.880
<i>But he fulfilled his promise
to protect the village.</i>

00:20:46.880 --> 00:20:50.810
<i>And yet, we did
something horrible to him...</i>

00:20:50.810 --> 00:20:56.390
<i>If that's the case, then won't
the bastard try to come back here?</i>

00:20:56.390 --> 00:21:01.260
<i>Yeah, he's as tenacious and
repulsive as a poisonous snake.</i>

00:21:01.260 --> 00:21:04.090
<i>And the fact that it's been three days</i>

00:21:04.090 --> 00:21:06.430
<i>and he still ain't back yet must mean...</i>

00:21:06.430 --> 00:21:10.730
<i>Too bad! He's dead!</i>

00:21:13.970 --> 00:21:16.230
<i>He's such an idiot!</i>

00:21:19.010 --> 00:21:20.740
<i>Please!</i>

00:21:20.740 --> 00:21:24.910
<i>Please accept my job!</i>

00:21:24.910 --> 00:21:28.120
<i>That's how we wound up
with the job of rescuing you</i>

00:21:28.120 --> 00:21:30.150
<i>if we found you on our way home.</i>

00:21:30.150 --> 00:21:36.090
<i>What a pity. Now Mariko-san
doesn't owe you squat!</i>

00:21:36.090 --> 00:21:37.260
<i>Serves you right!</i>

00:21:37.260 --> 00:21:39.360
<i>Still...</i>

00:21:39.360 --> 00:21:43.930
<i>Lugging this around for five days
when it's dangerous enough alone...</i>

00:21:43.930 --> 00:21:47.100
<i>That darn Kanta's got some tenacity...</i>

00:21:47.100 --> 00:21:50.160
<i>Or more like a grudge...</i>

00:21:51.340 --> 00:21:55.040
<i>And so this particular job
ended nice and neatly...</i>

00:21:55.040 --> 00:21:58.280
<i>...with the phenomenal disgrace
of having his life saved</i>

00:21:58.280 --> 00:22:01.980
<i>by the Kawaguchi brothers.</i>

00:22:06.420 --> 00:22:08.480
I burned out...

00:22:14.530 --> 00:22:18.120
...like a blazing-white flame...

00:22:22.640 --> 00:22:24.430
<i>Loser.</i>

00:23:56.400 --> 00:23:57.940
<i>Yo! Ghost of the Desert, Sunabouzu here!</i>

00:23:57.940 --> 00:23:59.170
<i>Next time's boob lady...</i>

00:23:59.170 --> 00:24:00.740
<i>What on earth?!</i>

00:24:00.740 --> 00:24:03.940
<i>Let's do it, Chief! Man the torpedoes!</i>

00:24:03.940 --> 00:24:06.410
<i>Yes, sir! Coordinates 9-9-9!</i>

00:24:06.410 --> 00:24:08.510
<i>On the next Sunabozu-
"Master and Pupil"</i>

00:24:08.510 --> 00:24:13.510
<i>Skip it and you'll never live it down!</i>
